| XA SparK on SARDet | 18.8 | 1.11 | 16.0 | -6.9, 4 % | +0.3, 54 % |
| RegionDINO scene+object | 18.4 | 1.07 | 11.6 | -7.3, 4 % | -0.1, 49 % |
